build/

# v4 has no external/ of its own: it reads Falcor, Slang, DLSS and the packman
# dependencies BY PATH out of C:\voxelbit\v3\external (override with DEPS before
# building -- see build.bat and the note v4.bat prints when the exe is missing).
#
# WARNING, AND IT IS THE SAME WARNING v2 CARRIES: that fork is HAND-PATCHED and
# the patches are not captured in this repo. A clone of this alone will not
# build v4; it needs that tree beside it.
external/
